    "html": "<p>An object of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1 kg\"></span> is thrown downwards from a height of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20 m\"></span>. The initial speed of the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6 m s^{-1}\"></span>.<br/>The object hits the ground at a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20 m s^{-1}\"></span>. Assume <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g=10 m s^{-2}\"></span>. What is the best estimate of the energy transferred from the object to the air as it falls?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6 J\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"18 J\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"182 J\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"200 J\"></span></li></ol>"
